    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invariant</strong> is an FPS currently in production by a small team of die-hard fans of classic shooters with a  story to tell. Having worked on titles like Serious Sam and Skywind, we're building a game that blends tight combat mechanics with smart puzzles and a unique  narrative in a chilling tone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/536d93805a392f72136cb14b8464d024.poster.avif?t=1734567032\" width=608 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/536d93805a392f72136cb14b8464d024.webm?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/536d93805a392f72136cb14b8464d024.mp4?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A SCIENTIFIC DISCOVERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set In the frozen expanse of <strong>Antarctica</strong>, you take control of a scientist summoned to the enigmatic <strong>Nabla Station</strong>, a cutting-edge research facility built to unlock the secrets of a potential <strong>world-saving energy source</strong> buried deep beneath the ice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But upon your arrival, chaos erupts: the station\u2019s AI goes rogue while eerie sounds echo from the tunnels near the massive drill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/d53e7442481e7d689b43b1b9a30c0c0a.poster.avif?t=1734567032\" width=608 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/d53e7442481e7d689b43b1b9a30c0c0a.webm?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/d53e7442481e7d689b43b1b9a30c0c0a.mp4?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>GRAB WHAT YOU CAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confused and surrounded by danger, you must traverse the station\u2019s labyrinth of halls, icy exteriors, and treacherous tunnels. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/4e082ed3d9ecda688a1ebb6fbd49d527.poster.avif?t=1734567032\" width=608 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/4e082ed3d9ecda688a1ebb6fbd49d527.webm?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/4e082ed3d9ecda688a1ebb6fbd49d527.mp4?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>JUST DON'T GET COLD FEET</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a mix of <strong>inventive tools and powerful weapons</strong>, you\u2019ll face AI-driven machines, strange creatures, and deranged former colleagues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/8457dc0b6ace1116abd889636155fbd3.poster.avif?t=1734567032\" width=608 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/8457dc0b6ace1116abd889636155fbd3.webm?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/8457dc0b6ace1116abd889636155fbd3.mp4?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But survival will require more than firepower - <strong>solving puzzles and outsmarting the station\u2019s corrupted systems</strong> will be crucial to reclaiming control and unraveling the station\u2019s dark, chilling secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your contribution is critical - add Invariant to your wishlist!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invariant</strong> is an FPS currently in production by a small team of die-hard fans of classic shooters with a  story to tell. Having worked on titles like Serious Sam and Skywind, we're building a game that blends tight combat mechanics with smart puzzles and a unique  narrative in a chilling tone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/536d93805a392f72136cb14b8464d024.poster.avif?t=1734567032\" width=608 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/536d93805a392f72136cb14b8464d024.webm?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/536d93805a392f72136cb14b8464d024.mp4?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A SCIENTIFIC DISCOVERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set In the frozen expanse of <strong>Antarctica</strong>, you take control of a scientist summoned to the enigmatic <strong>Nabla Station</strong>, a cutting-edge research facility built to unlock the secrets of a potential <strong>world-saving energy source</strong> buried deep beneath the ice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But upon your arrival, chaos erupts: the station\u2019s AI goes rogue while eerie sounds echo from the tunnels near the massive drill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/d53e7442481e7d689b43b1b9a30c0c0a.poster.avif?t=1734567032\" width=608 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/d53e7442481e7d689b43b1b9a30c0c0a.webm?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/d53e7442481e7d689b43b1b9a30c0c0a.mp4?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>GRAB WHAT YOU CAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confused and surrounded by danger, you must traverse the station\u2019s labyrinth of halls, icy exteriors, and treacherous tunnels. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/4e082ed3d9ecda688a1ebb6fbd49d527.poster.avif?t=1734567032\" width=608 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/4e082ed3d9ecda688a1ebb6fbd49d527.webm?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/4e082ed3d9ecda688a1ebb6fbd49d527.mp4?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>JUST DON'T GET COLD FEET</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a mix of <strong>inventive tools and powerful weapons</strong>, you\u2019ll face AI-driven machines, strange creatures, and deranged former colleagues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/8457dc0b6ace1116abd889636155fbd3.poster.avif?t=1734567032\" width=608 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/8457dc0b6ace1116abd889636155fbd3.webm?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351270/extras/8457dc0b6ace1116abd889636155fbd3.mp4?t=1734567032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But survival will require more than firepower - <strong>solving puzzles and outsmarting the station\u2019s corrupted systems</strong> will be crucial to reclaiming control and unraveling the station\u2019s dark, chilling secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your contribution is critical - add Invariant to your wishlist!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "As Nabla Station\u2019s search for energy beneath the Antarctic ice spirals into chaos, a scientist must take on rogue AI, strange creatures, and deranged colleagues using inventive tools, powerful weapons, and quick thinking to uncover the station\u2019s secrets and reclaim control.",
